    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the University GrantsCommission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1518/15 ofOctober 09, 2007 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2116/43 of March 27, 2019),which specifies the Faculties and Departments of the University of Jaffna, Sri Lanka, which is deemed, by virtue of theprovisions of section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by theaddition immediately after the item \u201cFaculty of Hindu Studies\u201d appearing in Column I and its corresponding entries inColumn II thereof, of the following :-",
